# P1 moves the tape speed: a glide from 1/8 to 1/4 (P1 117 -> 149) bends the repeats in pitch, a jump of more than an
# octave (to P1 60, 73 ms) crossfades, then back to 1/16. A saw keeps every glitch audible.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2
track fx1
input saw 110 0.25
param p1 117
param p2 150
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
sweep p1 117 149 8 20
param p1 60 28
param p1 85 38
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
